[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Objective
[stderr] +
[stderr] +After GATE-0001 / DEC-0001 selects the framework, package manager, and CI,
[stderr] +create the approved-runtime project skeleton and its reproducible shared
[stderr] +baseline. Document one bootstrap, lint, format, and deterministic sample-test
[stderr] +command without implementing game, content, rendering, service-worker, or
[stderr] +hosting behaviour.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Dependencies
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- No R-series dependencies.
[stderr] +- Implementation is blocked until GATE-0001 / DEC-0001 has approved the
[stderr] +  framework, package manager, and CI selection.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Owned files, data, and interfaces
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- Root build and tooling configuration for the approved stack.
[stderr] +- `src/core/`, `src/content/`, `src/app/`, `src/platform/web/`, and
[stderr] +  `src/platform/pwa/` directory boundaries only.
[stderr] +- `tests/` directory boundary and one deterministic non-product sample test.
[stderr] +- `docs/development.md` with the approved toolchain pin and command interface.
[stderr] +- The pinned toolchain declaration and documented bootstrap/lint/format/test
[stderr] +  command interface.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Required behaviour
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- Use only the approved GATE-0001 stack choices; record the exact pinned
[stderr] +  toolchain and the commands required for a clean checkout.
[stderr] +- Make bootstrap install project-local dependencies reproducibly, then make
[stderr] +  lint, format checking, and the deterministic sample test separately
[stderr] +  invocable through documented commands.
[stderr] +- Establish the listed shared, adapter, content, application, and test
[stderr] +  directory boundaries without adding domain implementation.
[stderr] +- Keep the shared core independent of browser APIs, timers, network calls, and
[stderr] +  renderer dependencies; later contracts own concrete dependency enforcement
[stderr] +  and adapters.
[stderr] +- Preserve the web/PWA shared-core rule: adapters may differ by platform but
[stderr] +  must not create target-specific campaign rules.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Non-goals
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- Selecting or substituting a framework, package manager, CI provider, host,
[stderr] +  renderer, storage API, or vendor.
[stderr] +- Gameplay, campaign state, authored content, UI screens, accessibility token
[stderr] +  values, persistence, service worker, PWA installation, hosting, or release
[stderr] +  work.
[stderr] +- Browser/device compatibility, performance, offline, or release claims.
[stderr] +- Accounts, network clients, diagnostics transport, credentials, and connected
[stderr] +  services.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Platform differences
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- The responsive web and PWA targets share this baseline and the same future
[stderr] +  core/content contracts.
[stderr] +- Reserve `src/platform/web/` for browser adaptation and `src/platform/pwa/`
[stderr] +  for later installation/cache adaptation. Do not add a service worker or PWA
[stderr] +  lifecycle behaviour in this task.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Asset assessment
[stderr] +
[stderr] +No visual, audio, source, or generated product asset is needed: this is a
[stderr] +tooling and directory-boundary contract. Do not create incidental art, icons,
[stderr] +fonts, textures, sprites, music, sound effects, content, or asset manifests.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Verification
[stderr] +
[stderr] +After GATE-0001 approval and implementation, from a clean checkout run the
[stderr] +approved documented commands for bootstrap, lint, format checking, and the
[stderr] +deterministic sample test. Record their command output, the pinned toolchain
[stderr] +version, and evidence that the sample test has no clock, RNG, network, browser,
[stderr] +or player-data dependency. Confirm the directory ownership matches this
[stderr] +runbook and that no product or platform lifecycle behaviour was added.
[stderr] +
[stderr] +## Acceptance criteria
[stderr] +
[stderr] +- A clean approved-runtime checkout executes the documented bootstrap, lint,
[stderr] +  format-check, and deterministic sample-test commands successfully.
[stderr] +- Toolchain and dependency versions are pinned and documented in
[stderr] +  `docs/development.md`.
[stderr] +- The shared, web-adapter, PWA-adapter, content, application, and test
[stderr] +  directories exist with no gameplay or platform lifecycle implementation.
[stderr] +- The shared core has no browser, timer, network, or renderer dependency.
[stderr] +- GATE-0001 remains explicit and unresolved; this task does not select its
[stderr] +  framework, package manager, or CI choices.
[stderr] 
