projects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/03-technical-contract.md:178:| Shared code/data boundary | Same rules core, content package, save schema, semantic actions, accessibility settings, and release compatibility rules. Browser adapter owns viewport/input differences. | Same shared core/data. Service worker, installation, cache lifecycle, and platform install affordance are PWA adapters. |
