tiplayer/safety, live service, IAP/entitlements / product owner / before any related implementation | exclude; or approve scoped service contracts | excluded from P0 | GATE-0006; protects offline campaign |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/decision-log.md-13-| DEC-0007 | Ratings, age, region, legal/store/certification policy / product/legal owner / before distribution claim | applicable approved policy | no certification/legal claim | GATE-0007 |\n--\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-29-| NFR-0008 | Maintain original-design provenance and prohibit copied reference expression in content and UI. | P0 | Brief non-goal/reference boundary | Shared | provenance/manual review | accepted |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-30-| NFR-0009 | Measure web compatibility, load/cache size, startup, interaction and slow-network behaviour against an approved numeric matrix/budget. | P1 | Web requirements; QOR-05 | Web, PWA | approved-matrix measurement | proposed |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-31-| NFR-0010 | Use a shared core and isolate only necessary web/PWA adapters; no target changes campaign rules. | P0 | Cross-platform decision | Shared, Web, PWA | architecture/contract review | accepted |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-32-| NFR-0011 | Build/release artifacts identify version and compatibility; cache rollout/rollback retain a known-good path. | P1 | PWA/release requirements | Web, PWA | release/rollback evidence | proposed |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-33-| NFR-0012 | Select no framework, vendor, host, storage quota, retention policy, legal/store policy, or support promise without approval. | P0 | Brief constraints; handoff | Shared | decision-log audit | accepted |\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-34-\nprojects/mock-fantasy-quest-4/specification/requirements.md-35-## Release gates and risks